' special.inc — namespace SPECIAL via FFI (libgmbmath: gmbsuite/gmbmath-special).
' Stessi nomi del builtin dismesso: i programmi restano `IMPORT SPECIAL` + `SPECIAL.X(...)`.
NAMESPACE SPECIAL

' --- gamma / beta / errore ---
PUBLIC DECLARE FUNCTION GAMMA LIB "gmbmath" ALIAS "gm_special_gamma" (x AS DOUBLE) AS DOUBLE
PUBLIC DECLARE FUNCTION LGAMMA LIB "gmbmath" ALIAS "gm_special_lgamma" (x AS DOUBLE) AS DOUBLE
PUBLIC DECLARE FUNCTION DIGAMMA LIB "gmbmath" ALIAS "gm_special_digamma" (x AS DOUBLE) AS DOUBLE
PUBLIC DECLARE FUNCTION BETA LIB "gmbmath" ALIAS "gm_special_beta" (a AS DOUBLE, b AS DOUBLE) AS DOUBLE
PUBLIC DECLARE FUNCTION BETALN LIB "gmbmath" ALIAS "gm_special_betaln" (a AS DOUBLE, b AS DOUBLE) AS DOUBLE
PUBLIC DECLARE FUNCTION BETAINC LIB "gmbmath" ALIAS "gm_special_betainc" (a AS DOUBLE, b AS DOUBLE, x AS DOUBLE) AS DOUBLE
PUBLIC DECLARE FUNCTION BETAINCINV LIB "gmbmath" ALIAS "gm_special_betaincinv" (a AS DOUBLE, b AS DOUBLE, y AS DOUBLE) AS DOUBLE
PUBLIC DECLARE FUNCTION GAMMAINC LIB "gmbmath" ALIAS "gm_special_gammainc" (a AS DOUBLE, x AS DOUBLE) AS DOUBLE
PUBLIC DECLARE FUNCTION GAMMAINCC LIB "gmbmath" ALIAS "gm_special_gammaincc" (a AS DOUBLE, x AS DOUBLE) AS DOUBLE
PUBLIC DECLARE FUNCTION GAMMAINCINV LIB "gmbmath" ALIAS "gm_special_gammaincinv" (a AS DOUBLE, y AS DOUBLE) AS DOUBLE
PUBLIC DECLARE FUNCTION GAMMAINCCINV LIB "gmbmath" ALIAS "gm_special_gammainccinv" (a AS DOUBLE, y AS DOUBLE) AS DOUBLE
PUBLIC DECLARE FUNCTION ERF LIB "gmbmath" ALIAS "gm_special_erf" (x AS DOUBLE) AS DOUBLE
PUBLIC DECLARE FUNCTION ERFC LIB "gmbmath" ALIAS "gm_special_erfc" (x AS DOUBLE) AS DOUBLE
PUBLIC DECLARE FUNCTION ERFINV LIB "gmbmath" ALIAS "gm_special_erfinv" (x AS DOUBLE) AS DOUBLE
PUBLIC DECLARE FUNCTION ERFCINV LIB "gmbmath" ALIAS "gm_special_erfcinv" (x AS DOUBLE) AS DOUBLE

' --- Bessel ---
PUBLIC DECLARE FUNCTION BESSELJ LIB "gmbmath" ALIAS "gm_special_besselj" (v AS DOUBLE, x AS DOUBLE) AS DOUBLE
PUBLIC DECLARE FUNCTION BESSELY LIB "gmbmath" ALIAS "gm_special_bessely" (v AS DOUBLE, x AS DOUBLE) AS DOUBLE
PUBLIC DECLARE FUNCTION BESSELI LIB "gmbmath" ALIAS "gm_special_besseli" (v AS DOUBLE, x AS DOUBLE) AS DOUBLE
PUBLIC DECLARE FUNCTION BESSELK LIB "gmbmath" ALIAS "gm_special_besselk" (v AS DOUBLE, x AS DOUBLE) AS DOUBLE

' --- gm_special2 ---
PUBLIC DECLARE FUNCTION ZETA LIB "gmbmath" ALIAS "gm_zeta" (s AS DOUBLE) AS DOUBLE
PUBLIC DECLARE FUNCTION ZETAHURWITZ LIB "gmbmath" ALIAS "gm_zeta_hurwitz" (s AS DOUBLE, a AS DOUBLE) AS DOUBLE
PUBLIC DECLARE FUNCTION POLYGAMMA LIB "gmbmath" ALIAS "gm_polygamma" (n AS LONG, x AS DOUBLE) AS DOUBLE
PUBLIC DECLARE FUNCTION HYPERGEOM2F1 LIB "gmbmath" ALIAS "gm_hypergeom_2f1" (a AS DOUBLE, b AS DOUBLE, c AS DOUBLE, x AS DOUBLE) AS DOUBLE
PUBLIC DECLARE FUNCTION HYPERGEOM1F1 LIB "gmbmath" ALIAS "gm_hypergeom_1f1" (a AS DOUBLE, b AS DOUBLE, x AS DOUBLE) AS DOUBLE
PUBLIC DECLARE FUNCTION LAMBERTW LIB "gmbmath" ALIAS "gm_lambert_w" (x AS DOUBLE) AS DOUBLE
PUBLIC DECLARE FUNCTION MITTAGLEFFLER LIB "gmbmath" ALIAS "gm_mittag_leffler" (a AS DOUBLE, b AS DOUBLE, x AS DOUBLE) AS DOUBLE
PUBLIC DECLARE FUNCTION STRUVEH LIB "gmbmath" ALIAS "gm_struve_h" (v AS DOUBLE, x AS DOUBLE) AS DOUBLE
PUBLIC DECLARE FUNCTION KELVINBER LIB "gmbmath" ALIAS "gm_kelvin_ber" (x AS DOUBLE) AS DOUBLE
PUBLIC DECLARE FUNCTION KELVINBEI LIB "gmbmath" ALIAS "gm_kelvin_bei" (x AS DOUBLE) AS DOUBLE
PUBLIC DECLARE FUNCTION PARABOLICCYLINDER LIB "gmbmath" ALIAS "gm_parabolic_cylinder" (a AS DOUBLE, x AS DOUBLE) AS DOUBLE

' ── Integrali e funzioni ellittiche, Airy, Bessel sferiche (2026-11-07) ─────
' Carlson RF/RD e gli integrali ellittici completi/incompleti. k è il MODULO
' (non il parametro m = k^2): K(0) = pi/2, F(phi, k) con phi in radianti.
PUBLIC DECLARE FUNCTION ELLIPTICRF LIB "gmbmath" ALIAS "gm_ellip_rf" (x AS DOUBLE, y AS DOUBLE, z AS DOUBLE) AS DOUBLE
PUBLIC DECLARE FUNCTION ELLIPTICRD LIB "gmbmath" ALIAS "gm_ellip_rd" (x AS DOUBLE, y AS DOUBLE, z AS DOUBLE) AS DOUBLE
PUBLIC DECLARE FUNCTION ELLIPTICK LIB "gmbmath" ALIAS "gm_ellip_K" (k AS DOUBLE) AS DOUBLE
PUBLIC DECLARE FUNCTION ELLIPTICE LIB "gmbmath" ALIAS "gm_ellip_E" (k AS DOUBLE) AS DOUBLE
PUBLIC DECLARE FUNCTION ELLIPTICF LIB "gmbmath" ALIAS "gm_ellip_F" (phi AS DOUBLE, k AS DOUBLE) AS DOUBLE
PUBLIC DECLARE FUNCTION ELLIPTICEINC LIB "gmbmath" ALIAS "gm_ellip_Einc" (phi AS DOUBLE, k AS DOUBLE) AS DOUBLE
' Jacobi: ampiezza am(u,k) e sn/cn/dn (sn^2 + cn^2 = 1, dn^2 + k^2 sn^2 = 1).
PUBLIC DECLARE FUNCTION JACOBIAM LIB "gmbmath" ALIAS "gm_ellip_am" (u AS DOUBLE, k AS DOUBLE) AS DOUBLE
PUBLIC DECLARE FUNCTION JACOBISN LIB "gmbmath" ALIAS "gm_ellip_sn" (u AS DOUBLE, k AS DOUBLE) AS DOUBLE
PUBLIC DECLARE FUNCTION JACOBICN LIB "gmbmath" ALIAS "gm_ellip_cn" (u AS DOUBLE, k AS DOUBLE) AS DOUBLE
PUBLIC DECLARE FUNCTION JACOBIDN LIB "gmbmath" ALIAS "gm_ellip_dn" (u AS DOUBLE, k AS DOUBLE) AS DOUBLE
' Nome q(k) della serie di Fourier delle funzioni ellittiche.
PUBLIC DECLARE FUNCTION ELLIPTICNOME LIB "gmbmath" ALIAS "gm_ellip_nome" (k AS DOUBLE) AS DOUBLE
' Bessel sferiche j_n(x) e y_n(x), n intero >= 0.
PUBLIC DECLARE FUNCTION BESSELSPHJ LIB "gmbmath" ALIAS "gm_bessel_sph_j" (n AS LONG, x AS DOUBLE) AS DOUBLE
PUBLIC DECLARE FUNCTION BESSELSPHY LIB "gmbmath" ALIAS "gm_bessel_sph_y" (n AS LONG, x AS DOUBLE) AS DOUBLE
